#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# expand_all

#% text
# `expand_all(e)` expands `e` everywhere: numerators and denominators, and the arguments of functions, which `expand` leaves alone.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
expand_all((x + 1)^2/(x + 2))
#% output
#= x^2/(2 + x) + 2*x/(2 + x) + (2 + x)^-1

#% cell
expand_all(1/(x + 1)^2 + sin((x + 1)^2))
#% output
#= (1 + x)^-2 + sin(1 + 2*x + x^2)

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `expand`, `expand_numerator`, `expand_denominator`
